0800F154 status-screen-update-return

BgGfx_LoadTilemapSimple exits through r0 and the caller preserves its return address.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/status_screen_fade.c
+++ b/src/status_screen_fade.c
@@ -190,4 +190,7 @@
     StatusScreen_RefreshDirtyDisplays(p);
     BgGfx_LoadTilemapSimple(0, 0, 0, 0, 0);
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return 0x0800F1B5; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
 
